  "docstring": "Let $p$ be a large prime, and let $A$ be the set of all primes less than $p$.\nIs every $x \\in \\{1, \\ldots, p-1\\}$ congruent to some product $a_1 a_2$ where $a_1, a_2 \\in A$?\n",
